OL,3,GNEWSADebt collectors to chase unpaid   
OL,4,Acouncil bills                          
OL,6,FDebt collectors are to be brought in to
OL,7,Fchase unpaid bills to aid a council's  
OL,8,Fdifficult financial position.          
OL,10,FWiltshire Council's cabinet member for 
OL,11,Ffinance Gavin Grant said debts,        
OL,12,Fincluding council tax arrears, that    
OL,13,Fwere more than a year old would be     
OL,14,Ftracked down by a third-party agency.  
OL,16,FThe move is part of a tougher approach 
OL,17,Fto the finances of the council, which  
OL,18,Fcurrently has outstanding debts        
OL,19,Ftotalling about #16.7m.                
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
